  "about": {
    "description": "wIJRx is the ERC-4626 wrapped version of IJRx (S&P Small Cap xStock). It wraps IJRx into a standardized vault-share token to enable DeFi composability such as use as collateral in lending markets, automated strategies, and other yield protocols. Each wIJRx represents a share claim on deposited IJRx. Underlying real-world exposure, redemption mechanics, and reference price tracking are inherited from the underlying IJRx xStock issued by Backed. The wrapper does not rebase, so its share-to-underlying ratio grows with the xStocks multiplier, making it a total-return tracker rather than a price-parity tracker.",
